# platform -> shell include edges, baselined.
#
# EMPTY, and meant to stay that way. The one edge that existed --
# platform/thread.cpp -> shell/uci.h -- was severed rather than recorded, because
# a baseline is a debt register and this debt was payable the same afternoon it
# was found. Recording it first would have bought a gate that could not fail for
# the only case it was built for.
#
# Format matches the other two baselines: `<file> -> <header>`, one per line.
